# x0x37

Initialize [$x0x37-task](skills/x0x37-task/SKILL.md) at task start and
[$x0x37-writing](skills/x0x37-writing/SKILL.md) before output.
Apply [development routing](skills/x0x37-task/references/routing.md): use dot's
cloud machine and supported native subagents for authorized development.
Use [skill triggers](docs/agent-rules.md) when each later step begins.
Read its `SKILL.md`. Do not load the old rule files.
Current owner instructions take priority. Keep independent tasks in isolated lanes.
The assigned integration owner controls firmware; a routing change does not transfer ownership.
